          <h3 class="post-title">NocturneAI</h3>
          <p class="post-stack">TypeScript · React Ink · ReAct · workflow engine · ~30K LOC</p>
          <p>
            Multi-agent CLI for the terminal, still in development. A coordinator runs agents. ReAct loops call registered tools. A workflow engine validates a plan before it runs. Plugin manager, metrics, and a background-task manager sit beside that.
          </p>
          <p>
            Layered layout: core, application, infrastructure, presentation. Model calls go through GitHub Copilot’s OpenAI-compatible API. Public repo.
